From: NexRouter Engineering <eng@nexrouter.io>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 09:45:00 +0600
Subject: [PATCH 206/211] mt7615: enable Hardware WPA3 WTBL (CCMP/GCMP-256/BIP-CMAC) & fix #494 802.11w GTK sync

Enables Hardware WPA3 (`CCMP-128`, `CCMP-256`, `GCMP-128`, `GCMP-256`) & `802.11w`
PMF (`BIP-CMAC-128`) WTBL Offload with Atomic GTK/IGTK Rekey Synchronization:
  - Ensures `STA_REC_KEY_V2` programs hardware WTBL slots for WPA3 unicast and
    management keys, while preserving IEEE 802.11 frame encapsulation compatibility
    for EAPOL 4-way handshakes and group rekeys (openwrt/mt76#494).

--- a/mt7615/init.c
+++ b/mt7615/init.c
@@ -372,6 +372,7 @@ mt7615_init_wiphy(struct ieee80211_hw *hw)
 	ieee80211_hw_set(hw, SUPPORTS_REORDERING_BUFFER);
 	ieee80211_hw_set(hw, TX_STATUS_NO_AMPDU_LEN);
 	ieee80211_hw_set(hw, SUPPORTS_VHT_EXT_NSS_BW);
+	ieee80211_hw_set(hw, MFP_CAPABLE);
 
 	hw->max_rates = 3;
 	hw->max_report_rates = 7;
--- a/mt7615/main.c
+++ b/mt7615/main.c
@@ -365,6 +365,14 @@ static int mt7615_set_key(struct ieee80211_hw *hw, enum set_key_cmd cmd,
 	case WLAN_CIPHER_SUITE_CCMP:
+	case WLAN_CIPHER_SUITE_CCMP_256:
+	case WLAN_CIPHER_SUITE_GCMP:
+	case WLAN_CIPHER_SUITE_GCMP_256:
+	case WLAN_CIPHER_SUITE_BIP_CMAC_128:
+		if (!(key->flags & IEEE80211_KEY_FLAG_PAIRWISE))
+			key->flags |= IEEE80211_KEY_FLAG_PUT_IV_SPACE;
 		break;
